usage: training.py [-h] [--train] [--infer] [--export] [--batch BATCH]
                   [--epochs EPOCHS] [--output OUTPUT]

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --train, -t           If explicitly given, the training phase will be
                        executed
  --infer, -i           If explicitly given, the inference phase will be
                        executed
  --export              If explicitly given, the dataset will be exported
  --batch BATCH, -b BATCH
                        The BATCH_SIZE used for the training phase
  --epochs EPOCHS, -e EPOCHS
                        The amount of EPOCHS used for the training phase
  --output OUTPUT, -o OUTPUT
                        The location in which the model is stored in
